147	    /**
148	     * When no registration date is supplied, default it to the server's current date, then roll
149	     * the effective date forward onto a business day: a Saturday or Sunday becomes the following
150	     * Monday. Running on {@link PrePersist} keeps both invariants true for every create path
151	     * (any controller, bulk import or test fixture) rather than a single entry point. The roll is
152	     * idempotent, so a date already adjusted by a caller is left unchanged.
